date-released: 2026-09-11
abstract: "Output-aware recurrent-state quantization through fixed precision masks and bounded integer-code correction. Includes reproducible GDN model experiments, an independent GDN2 operator implementation, factorized FP64 metric execution, and CPU-recomputable observations. Quality, storage, numerical failures and runtime are reported separately; pretrained GDN2 language quality and production readiness are not claimed."
